// chapter 4). Two 512 px tileable strips, bottom on the horizon. far (72):
// the skyline over a band of sodium haze: the bridge's two wishbone towers
// lit blue with white cable fans, the two Back Bay towers standing apart
// (the boxy one with the lit crown and mast, the tall blue glass slab with
// its notch), downtown with the glass tower's sloped crown and the
// floodlit clock tower on its classical base, the waterfront line and its
// reflections. near (48): the harbor: islands like low loaves, the row of
// silver egg digesters, ships at anchor, buoys, glints and reflections.
// Original silhouettes, no signs or marks.
